OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you fill a 150 billion
OL,4,Alitre reservoir?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs plans move forward to build a 150
OL,7,Fbillion litre reservoir in the Thames
OL,8,FValley, attention is now turning to how
OL,9,Fto fill it.
OL,11,FThames Water will be applying for
OL,12,Fplanning permission for the White Horse
OL,13,FReservoir, near Abingdon in
OL,14,FOxfordshire, by the end of the year,
OL,15,Fwith a view to supplying 15 million
OL,16,Fcustomers across the south east by
OL,17,F2040.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
