OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you fill a 150 billion
OL,4,Alitre reservoir?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the plans, the facility,
OL,7,Fwith an estimated cost of between
OL,8,F#5.5bn and #7.5bn, would be filled with
OL,9,Fwater from the River Thames in the
OL,10,Fwinter "when there's plenty of water."
OL,12,FBut with the Thames Valley only having
OL,13,F35% of its average rainfall so far this
OL,14,Fmonth, an innovative project is finding
OL,15,Fnatural ways to harvest the water
OL,16,Ffurther up stream.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
